  #|{"in":{"id":16,"value":{"archived":false,"pinned":false,"me":{"id":"alice@example.test","email":"alice@example.test"},"thread":{"id":1,"surface":"ember","channel":"EMBER","threadTs":"1792456186.686000","createdBy":"alice@example.test","creator":{"id":"alice@example.test","name":"Name of alice","email":"alice@example.test","via":"cloud","shown":{"name":"Name of alice","display":"你","picture":"https://example.test/p.png","mine":true}},"createdAt":1792456186686,"sessions":[{"thread":1,"session":"ember:c-686b9caa18","connect":"ember","joinedAt":1792456186692}],"last":30,"lastMessage":{"seq":30,"thread":1,"ts":"1792456884.605000","authorKind":"ember","author":"ember","authorName":"still.fail","text":"⚠️ 本轮 agent 未在对话中回复，以下是它最后输出的文字，由 station 代为转发（并非它发布的消息）；回复即可继续：\n\n> Your turn ended without a state, so nobody knows where the chat stands. Only a real unresolved need requires need_human. A factual answer alone does not need a follow-up question; do not invent one. If you still need something after answering a clarification, visibly ask for it; need alone is only a status summary. Cards are optional. Do not reopen a decision the user already made. Decide whether anything in it is still unfinished, then end the turn with exactly one:\n> - all_done: nothing in the chat is left unfinished at all. Post the result with chat_post kind \"all_done\" (or chat_state \"all_done\" if you already posted it), with done: why nothing is left, naming the evidence (a commit, a release, a person's confirmation, the answer given).\n> - need_human: a person has to give, do, decide, confirm or verify something (a card you posted included), or answer a question you asked: kind \"need_human\" with need, what they have to give, do or decide (to verify: where, how and what to look at). If work you started is pending too, mention it after the ask in need.\n> - waiting: only work you started that will bring you back on its own (a background command or agent, a job, a loop watching CI), with nothing asked of anyone, and nothing else you can do meanwhile: chat_state \"waiting\" with seconds, your estimate of how long until it does, and for, what you wait for. Waiting on a person is need_human.\n> - Otherwise: continue the work.","attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1792456884605,"time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792456884605,"ago":"9 分钟前","full":"10/20 08:41:24","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},"read":30,"unread":0,"people":[{"id":"alice@example.test","name":"Name of alice","email":"alice@example.test","via":"cloud","shown":{"name":"Name of alice","display":"你","picture":"https://example.test/p.png","mine":true}}],"firstText":"端到端测试的对话 post:你好，我是测试用的 agent","time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792456186686,"ago":"21 分钟前","full":"10/20 08:29:46","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},"title":"端到端测试的对话 post:你好，我是测试用的 agent","people":[{"id":"alice@example.test","name":"Name of alice","email":"alice@example.test","via":"cloud","shown":{"name":"Name of alice","display":"你","picture":"https://example.test/p.png","mine":true}}],"agents":[{"session":{"key":"ember:c-686b9caa18","connect":"ember","scope":"all","createdBy":"alice@example.test","boundTo":[],"creator":{"id":"alice@example.test","name":"Name of alice","email":"alice@example.test","via":"cloud"},"participants":[{"id":"alice@example.test","name":"Name of alice","email":"alice@example.test","via":"cloud"}],"runtime":"claude","profile":"cc","profilePinned":false,"runtimeSessionId":"10236c2a-ae9a-462b-a57e-1622233f856d","workspace":"/tmp/mbe2e-A/data/sessions/ember/c-686b9caa18/workspace","running":false,"createdAt":1792456186674,"lastActiveAt":1792456884604,"process":"warm","turns":33,"pending":0,"firstText":"端到端测试的对话 post:你好，我是测试用的 agent","lastTurn":{"id":"e63f82f5-ad71-4250-8f93-8d5cdcddb8af","kind":"nudge","outcome":"completed","startedAt":1792456884601,"endedAt":1792456884605},"statusText":"出错：意外停止","tone":"red","mark":"failed","badgeText":"失败，需要处理","titleText":"端到端测试的对话 post:你好，我是测试用的 agent","agentText":"默认模型","runtimeText":"C